OL,3,GNEWSABoys' rescue a 'stark' safety
OL,4,Awarning, says RNLI
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat commander who helped rescue
OL,7,Ffive boys said he was shocked to
OL,8,Fdiscover the youngest was just six.
OL,10,FThe children were rescued half a mile
OL,11,F(0.8km) offshore after they were
OL,12,Freported missing near the Shoeburyness
OL,13,FBoom, a coastal defence barrier, on
OL,14,FShoebury East Beach in Essex at 16:45
OL,15,FBST on Sunday.
OL,17,FRNLI volunteer commander Jonathan
OL,18,FCharnock said: "Seeing the one who was
OL,19,Fso young, the same age as my son - it
OL,20,Fsort of hit home actually, what it was
OL,21,Fthat we were dealing with."
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
