OL,3,GNEWSABoys' rescue a 'stark' safety
OL,4,Awarning, says RNLI
OL,5,
OL,6,FNone of the youngsters, aged up to 14,
OL,7,Fhad mobile phones, some were not
OL,8,Fwearing shoes and they had strayed into
OL,9,Fa military firing area after becoming
OL,10,Ftrapped by the rising tide.
